  "body": {
    "type": "doc",
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Aloo gobi serves 4 and takes about 45 minutes. Cut the potato and cauliflower into even pieces so they cook at the same rate. Keep the heat steady so the vegetables brown without sticking."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Cover the pan part of the time so the steam softens the cauliflower without adding water."
          }
        ]
      },
